agraph","text":"ぜひご覧ください⭐️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相変わらず寒いので、、🥶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪ひかないようにー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/e26/21b80827bc4cbf04c370d3727acf2-01.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では!"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-keya-31160":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは👋🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近映画を観に行けていません。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんはどうですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、『ジョーカー』という映画が気になっています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジョーカーというキャラクター自体、聞いたことはありましたが詳しくは知らなくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これを機に調べてみたところ、とても観てみたくなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深そう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観たよ〜という方は是非感想を教えていただきたい😊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分私も観に行くと思います!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/0bd/e819ac8cf25aeb1d37c1cae9b930e.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね〜👋🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"齋藤冬優花"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-keya-29290":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生 東京都出身"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松平璃子です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう5月も終わりですね〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ何を書いていいものか、文字に気持ちを詰めこむのが私は苦手みたいですね。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思ったこと感じたことをすぐ簡単に言えたらいいんですけどね。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月はもう何が何だか分からないぐらいの早さで過ぎていった気がします、お見立て会から武道館まで無我夢中だったので自分の誕生日が自分でもあっさりしていました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46四期生の田村真佑と連絡は取っていたんですが中々お互い会えなくて、やっと会えました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったー!❤︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたらずっと前から買ってくれてたみたいで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しいーーーー(T_T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目の前にペンがあって面白いからサイン書いてもらった。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/2d7/d7f78ccb38387f9b35c279fb24ac2.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふふ。まゆは一緒にいるだけでいいんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"坂道合同オーディション関東組の最年長コンビ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無言でも落ち着く関係。?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ、基本2人だとわちゃわちゃするか食べてます👼🏻💭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/2d7/d7f78ccb38387f9b35c279fb24ac2-01.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服が正反対で笑いました〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日プレゼントの中身はアロマキャンドル。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"匂いも色々考えてくれたみたい💭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと欲しかったの、本当に!笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラベンダーの香り寝る前にたきたかったんだ〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/2d7/d7f78ccb38387f9b35c279fb24ac2-02.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドアップ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/2d7/d7f78ccb38387f9b35c279fb24ac2-03.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛とかメイクとか色々話した!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まゆは本当に可愛い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また映画一緒に見るから楽しみだー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ頑張ろー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の日記みたいになっちゃった。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真苦手意識強くて自撮り取らないと写真が無いんだよねー、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでくれてありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松平璃子"}],"source":"official"}}